_hat_amq/6.3",{"plaintext":1097},"/documentation/red_hat_amq/6.3/*",{"uid":1099,"title":1001,"bannerVariant":961,"bannerType":1002,"bannerText":1100,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1101,"latestVersionLink":1106,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"19",{"markdown":15},[1102,1104],{"plaintext":1103},"/documentation/red_hat_build_of_microshift/4.14/*",{"plaintext":1105},"/documentation/red_hat_build_of_microshift/4.15/*","/documentation/red_hat_build_of_microshift/latest",{"uid":858,"title":1108,"bannerVariant":961,"bannerType":1002,"bannerText":1109,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1111,"latestVersionLink":15,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"Red Hat Camel K is no longer supported.",{"markdown":1110},"As of June 30, 2025, Red Hat build of Camel K has reached End of Life. The suggested replacements is [Red Hat build of Apache Camel](https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_build_of_apache_camel \"\"). For details about moving, see the [Camel K to Camel Quarkus migration guide](https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_build_of_apache_camel_k/latest/html/migration_guide_camel_k_to_camel_extensions_for_quarkus/index).\n",[1112],{"plaintext":1113},"/documentation/red_hat_build_of_apache_camel_k/*",{"uid":1115,"title":1001,"bannerVariant":961,"bannerType":1002,"bannerText":1116,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1117,"latestVersionLink":1134,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"12",{"markdown":15},[1118,1120,1122,1124,1126,1128,1130,1132],{"plaintext":1119},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.0/*",{"plaintext":1121},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.1/*",{"plaintext":1123},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.2/*",{"plaintext":1125},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.3/*",{"plaintext":1127},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.4/*",{"plaintext":1129},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.5/*",{"plaintext":1131},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.6/*",{"plaintext":1133},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.7/*","/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/",{"uid":864,"title":1136,"bannerVariant":961,"bannerType":1002,"bannerText":1137,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1139,"latestVersionLink":15,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"Red Hat Hyperconverged Infrastructure for Virtualization",{"markdown":1138},"is in the [Maintenance Support Phase](https://access.redhat.com/support/policy/updates/rhhiv) of its lifecycle until October 31, 2024. After that date, the product will be End of Life. See the [RHHI-V announcement](https://access.redhat.com/announcements/6972521) for next steps.\n",[1140],{"plaintext":1141},"/documentation/red_hat_hyperconverged_infrastructure_for_virtualization/1.8",{"uid":1143,"title":1001,"bannerVariant":961,"bannerType":1002,"bannerText":1144,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1145,"latestVersionLink":1194,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"13",{"markdown":15},[1146,1148,1150,1152,1154,1156,1158,1160,1162,1164,1166,1168,1170,1172,1174,1176,1178,1180,1182,1184,1186,1188,1190,1192],{"plaintext":1147},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.0/*",{"plaintext":1149},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.1/*",{"plaintext":1151},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.2/*",{"plaintext":1153},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.3/*",{"plaintext":1155},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.4/*",{"plaintext":1157},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.5/*",{"plaintext":1159},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.6/*",{"plaintext":1161},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.7/*",{"plaintext":1163},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.8/*",{"plaintext":1165},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.9/*",{"plaintext":1167},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.10/*",{"plaintext":1169},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.11/*",{"plaintext":1171},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.12/*",{"plaintext":1173},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.13/*",{"plaintext":1175},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.14/*",{"plaintext":1177},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.15/*",{"plaintext":1179},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.16/*",{"plaintext":1181},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.17/*",{"plaintext":1183},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.18/*",{"plaintext":1185},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.19/*",{"plaintext":1187},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.20/*",{"plaintext":1189},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.21/*",{"plaintext":1191},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.22/*",{"plaintext":1193},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.23/*","/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/latest",{"uid":1196,"title":1001,"bannerVariant":961,"bannerType":1002,"bannerText":1197,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1198,"latestVersionLink":1209,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"16",{"markdown":15},[1199,1201,1203,1205,1207],{"plaintext":1200},"/documentation/red_hat_trusted_application_pipeline/1.0/*",{"plaintext":1202},"/documentation/red_hat_trusted_application_pipeline/1.1/*",{"plaintext":1204},"/documentation/red_hat_trusted_application_pipeline/1.2/*",{"plaintext":1206},"/documentation/red_hat_trusted_application_pipeline/1.3/*",{"plaintext":1208},"/documentation/red_hat_trusted_application_pipeline/1.4/*","/documentation/red_hat_advanced_developer_suite_-_software_supply_chain/latest",{"uid":867,"title":1211,"bannerVariant":961,"bannerType":1002,"bannerText":1212,"bannerVisibilityPaths":1214,"latestVersionLink":15,"viewAnnouncementLink":15},"The Red Hat Virtualization",{"markdown":1213},"Maintenance Phase runs until August 31, 2024, followed by the Extended Life Phase with no more software fixes through August 31, 2026. See [Migration Paths for OpenShift Container Platform deployed on Red Hat Virtualization](https://access.redhat.com/articles/6975303\\) for details.\n",[1215],{"plaintext":1216},"/documentation/red_hat_virtualization/4.4",{"uid":850,"title":1218,"bannerVariant":961,"bannerType":1219,"bannerText":1220